Calculate ivnType as pnType
Do inherited

Do ivoData.$GetServer(ivcServer)
Do ivoData.$GetSchemaRegistryUrl(ivcSchemaRegistryUrl)
Do ivoData.$GetTopic_Schema(ivcTopic)
Do ivoData.$GetLstConfig(ivLstConfig)
Do ivoData.$GetSchemaStr(ivcSchemaStr)
Do ivoData.$DefRowSchemaInfo(ivRowSchemaInfoFromSubject)
Do ivRowSchemaInfoFromId.$copydefinition(ivRowSchemaInfoFromSubject)

Do ivLstSubjects.$define()
Do ivLstSubjects.$cols.$add("Name",kCharacter,kSimplechar)
Do ivLstTopics.$copydefinition(ivLstSubjects)

Calculate ivcSubjectGetSchemaFromSubject as con(ivcTopic,"-value")
Calculate ivcSubjectRegisterSchema as ivcSubjectGetSchemaFromSubject

Quit method